	 ('5980d78d-c740-4cf6-9f90-37ff604b638d'::uuid,'title:What’s New in Kotlin: Language and Ecosystem Strategy, description:In this talk, I’ll share key updates from the Kotlin ecosystem, with a strong focus on language features and libraries.

