	 ('13507d34-cdd2-454b-80f9-ded6e663dfae'::uuid,'title:47 Refactorings in 45 Minutes, description:IntelliJ IDEA''s refactoring support is second to none, but the Refactor This menu only has 9 items. Where is all the power hiding?

Join Dmitry and Duncan on a whistle-stop live-coding tour of our favourite IDE''s invisible refactorings. Marvel as Alt-Enter reveals refactorings before your very eyes. Gasp as they change depending on context. Wonder how completely different they can be simply by moving the cursor one character to the left or right, and feel the tension mount as they approach the deadline. Can they really show more than one refactoring a minute?','{"id": "5dab8377a31146e1abe3ea0d4ac5c863", "room": "Black Box", "title": "47 Refactorings in 45 Minutes", "endsAt": 1764242100000, "category": "[Presentation]", "dayIndex": 1, "speakers": "[Duncan McGregor, Dmitry Kandalov]", "startsAt": 1764239400000, "phaseOfDay": "MORNING", "conferenceDay": "2025-11-27", "durationMinutes": 45, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2025-11-27T12:15:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2025-11-27T11:30:00"}','[-0.047231875,0.07427683,0.025689937,-0.00853105,0.005136605,-0.026395097,0.013563955,0.06559368,0.001272917,-0.0024507758,0.0715668,-0.024735898,0.014296768,0.04026324,0.014918968,0.020698512,0.014490341,-0.015126368,0.035562173,0.06587022,0.033737052,-0.047923207,0.01681322,0.058293205,0.0332946,0.012236595,-0.08024994,-0.021555765,0.031773668,-0.020532591,0.010210989,-0.010653443,0.005032905,-0.015803874,0.027929856,-0.010162597,0.0020290625,-0.04725953,0.051988248,-0.005803741,-0.033654094,-0.01089541,-0.010957629,0.00863475,0.035479214,0.035175025,0.019260539,0.011006023,0.033239294,0.034317773,-0.013563955,0.008690056,-0.015928313,-0.0010171238,0.016509034,0.005299068,-0.04145233,0.043083876,0.0076184906,-0.00996211,0.06432163,-0.02563463,0.00036619048,0.055776753,-0.086610205,-0.0031455655,-0.07090312,0.046900034,0.047397796,-0.05641278,-0.030639881,0.0026841005,0.014849834,-0.02733531,0.01847242,0.04966537,0.013073108,0.030695189,0.028109603,0.025358098,0.0002977053,0.0016082135,-0.01776726,-0.00975471,-0.033101026,-0.014504168,-0.058790963,-0.044217665,-0.015195501,-0.076101944,-0.02584203,-0.0035914753,0.004