	 ('a35e1702-4885-45a3-addb-6dc6844d05c6'::uuid,'title:Building AI agents in Kotlin with Koog, description:AI provides great new opportunities for powerful user interactions, and Kotlin is uniquely positioned to implement them! In this session, we’ll see how you can enhance your applications with AI capabilities, including the ability to create complex agentic workflows. We''ll do so by diving into Koog, the multiplatform framework built by JetBrains that designed to build agents in idiomatic Kotlin. We''ll see what it takes to get started from scratch, and how Koog covers not just basic cases, but provides you everything you need to scale your AI agents in production deployments.

The talk starts the audience off at zero, and then introduces the core concepts of Koog, such as executors, graphs, and nodes, walks through some actual code examples, and also provides an overview over the advanced features we''ve built for koog.ai, such as history compression and observability / tracing. Listeners will walk away with a good basic and practical understanding to support their own adventures with Koog in a multiplatform setting.','{"id": "2e1cc2639eaf47b0ba0d35f938350efe", "room": "Black Box", "title": "Building AI agents in Kotlin with Koog", "endsAt": 1764245700000, "category": "[Presentation]", "dayIndex": 1, "speakers": "[Sebastian Aigner]", "startsAt": 1764243000000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2025-11-27", "durationMinutes": 45, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2025-11-27T13:15:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2025-11-27T12:30:00"}','[-0.034077667,0.043148696,0.013606549,-0.015972374,0.003895028,-0.0058226227,-0.025570506,0.027654393,-0.008249737,0.012650413,0.031209257,-0.052268762,-0.0102723325,-0.048346154,-0.0018754974,-0.021194346,-0.043320313,-0.04292805,0.029223436,0.014096876,-0.011620729,-0.013434935,0.054671362,0.01320203,-0.011344921,-0.029640215,-0.017406577,0.02740923,0.012895577,-0.047218405,0.0088687735,-0.02076531,-0.030571833,-0.046360333,0.041849334,-0.03822092,0.031503454,0.0039655124,-0.011841375,0.0049339067,-0.0044374513,-0.072028905,-0.013790422,0.041432556,-0.016364634,0.05275909,-0.016805928,-0.003291314,-0.03145442,0.006889082,-0.068400495,-0.008445867,0.025791153,0.007955541,-0.068841785,0.028757626,0.03285185,0.047512602,1.3754509e-05,-0.0006561942,0.01294461,-0.024871793,0.06217335,0.0063864975,-0.05349458,-0.022935005,-0.04187385,-0.0027059873,-0.01778658,-0.00464584,0.042094495,-0.005084069,-0.062957875,0.027041486,-0.018240131,-0.016278828,-0.043075148,0.02382985,0.02462663,-0.008151672,-0.013324612,0.026845355,-0.01877949,-0.021525316,-0.008366189,-0.0068706945,-0.061339796,-0.037485432,-0.061143667,0.0070