	 ('7b7f10d0-6694-44e1-976c-6dc529f91477'::uuid,'title:Can LLMs play text adventures? – Kotlin edition, description:The title says it all! In this talk, we will explore the gaming capabilities of Large Language Models (LLMs). Since the release of ChatGPT, these models have seen steady improvements. Given that the second ''L'' in LLM stands for ''Language,'' it’s fitting that one of the most obvious games to play with an LLM is a text adventure. By the end of this talk, you’ll discover whether, and how well, LLMs can navigate and play text adventures.

I made a little tool that hooks up LLMs with text adventures. This will be used in the demos. The first version is built in Java, but for this conference I put together a Kotlin version.','{"id": "b42fddaf6e8a4f9a9993ce0a140b4f2b", "room": "Black Box", "title": "Can LLMs play text adventures? – Kotlin edition", "endsAt": 1764248400000, "category": "[Fast Forward]", "dayIndex": 1, "speakers": "[Bouke Nijhuis]", "startsAt": 1764246600000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2025-11-27", "durationMinutes": 30, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2025-11-27T14:00:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2025-11-27T13:30:00"}','[-0.023134826,0.04632259,0.04611083,-0.048572544,-0.00056455657,0.0013888505,-0.049419586,0.018886382,0.009456426,0.020673111,0.008496887,-0.033908136,-0.0021688899,0.027661204,-0.0075373473,-0.0036528672,-0.044469688,-0.037561003,0.016504077,0.067445695,0.009906417,0.0006460347,0.029672928,-0.010640961,0.0021142955,-0.0140026575,-0.03070526,0.039731547,0.03681984,-0.019362843,0.019534899,-0.02043488,-0.028693536,-0.014452648,0.013082823,0.032981686,0.037349243,0.012341661,0.013261496,-0.031155251,-0.01354605,-0.063369304,-0.033061095,0.004331162,-0.06506339,0.077398434,0.0081726285,0.018449627,-0.03533752,-0.002410429,-0.068769194,0.018449627,0.047010813,0.031896412,-0.03634338,-0.05548123,-0.008424094,0.00776896,0.0061708307,-0.039016858,-0.0150746945,0.007941016,0.027608264,0.006048407,-0.02317453,-0.02333335,-0.057334132,-0.008304979,-0.0037686736,0.0069880937,0.027793555,-0.024127452,-0.06035172,0.029487638,-0.033246387,0.0055256234,-0.02517302,0.054369487,0.04184915,-0.005787015,-0.021573093,0.013155616,-0.025662715,-0.026311232,-0.026999453,0.0037719824,-0.026668578,0.010779928,-0.044416748,-0.019627543,0.020831931,-0.0022102494,-0.033458147,0.02543772,0.09772743,0.034066956,0.018780502,-0.023505406,0.049313705,0.014082068,0.03568163,0.037349243,0.007596905,-0.057863533,0.06606925,0.026218586,0.011223302,0.014862934,-0.039678607,-0.005545476,-0.14886758