	 ('c9a3181f-5cc0-4d43-b931-baa591ae4902'::uuid,'title:Vibe code a Kotlin compiler plugin, description:Vibe-driven development is often associated with rapid prototyping, particularly in frontend applications. However, its underlying principles of embracing intuition and iterative progress can be a powerful methodology for navigating highly complex software domains.

