	 ('90447581-621f-4a2e-b6da-c8629214905a'::uuid,'title:Supercharge your LLM with Kotlin 💪: Model Context Protocol (MCP) in Action, description:The Model Context Protocol (MCP) is said to become the ''HTTP of AI''. Bold claim or inevitable reality? In this talk, we''ll crack open the LLM black box and discover how MCP seamlessly bridges AI with the real world.

Get to know how MCP transforms your language models from impressive chatbots into powerful, connected agents that can tap into APIs, query databases, and execute complex workflows—all through a beautifully simple, pluggable architecture.

We will witness live MCP magic with real-world off-the-shelf integrations that boost any (development) workflow with jaw-dropping automation, making you rethink what''s possible. And yes, we will also consider the less exciting aspects of MCP like security and deployment as well as what the future holds to solve these ''issues''.

Finally, get to know how easy it is to build your own MCP server in Kotlin using the official Kotlin SDK, so you can bridge any productivity gap you might encounter yourself.

By the end, you''ll understand not just how MCP works, but how to wield it as your AI superpower. With MCP, your AI will never taste the same!','{"id": "8ec2e184a03642c3b0f297c9299220be", "room": "Black Box", "title": "Supercharge your LLM with Kotlin 💪: Model Context Protocol (MCP) in Action", "endsAt": 1764254700000, "category": "[Presentation]", "dayIndex": 1, "speakers": "[Urs Peter]", "startsAt": 1764252000000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2025-11-27", "durationMinutes": 45, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2025-11-27T15:45:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2025-11-27T15:00:00"}','[-0.01526128,-0.00020760811,0.018796455,-0.0021761332,-0.015874933,0.003625221,-0.010111933,0.05917748,-0.017982697,0.03428452,0.015541426,-0.030095672,-0.0056029176,-0.016995518,-0.03190995,-0.0120796235,-0.06414007,-0.010191974,0.031749867,0.028628241,-0.0015874933,0.02049067,0.05432162,0.016475245,-0.005089317,-0.023932463,-0.05714976,-0.00060698274,0.03956727,-0.0053594573,0.011179155,-0.005136008,-0.07193079,-0.039380506,0.0071570603,0.013026783,0.029401977,0.029401977,-0.033217296,0.021331107,-0.023158725,-0.060351428,-0.024932984,0.047944967,0.0031733192,0.044529855,-0.014500884,-0.0001334028,-0.0007249608,0.02009046,-0.063499734,-0.004055445,0.018236162,0.058377065,-0.07817404,-0.00055737357,0.020597393,-0.011252526,0.0034951533,0.01479437,0.015848253,-0.03423116,0.008257633,-0.00949828,-0.068195514,-0.057309844,-0.006533402,0.009378217,-0.022024803,0.029695462,0.0209976,0.025653359,-0.05293423,0.010452109,-0.03423116,-0.027054088,-0.029188532,0.06595434,0.035431784,-0.0013873891,-0.037779674,-0.007917456,0.008871286,-0.023305468,-0.016341843,-0.007844085,-0.06051151,0.014887753,-0.08543115,-0.002833142,0.01380719,0.013086814,-0.024212608,0.007343824,0.09370213,0.046797704,0.022798538,0.028841686,0.044129647,0.033297338,0.006156539,-0.04034101,0.013460343,-0.019997079,0.064620316,0.006376654,0.05763001,-0.027374255,-0.01899656,0.003525169,-0.116967574,-0.015994996,-0.02486