	 ('bc651913-e7bd-44e3-a11b-4237874e2660'::uuid,'title:Beyond data classes: Kotlin‑powered domain modeling, description:Proper domain modeling is one of the key elements in building robust software. Kotlin offers powerful tools for effective modeling, making it an excellent choice for developing backend systems that handle business logic in complex domains.

In this talk, I''ll demonstrate how Kotlin''s features make it the ideal tool for domain modeling, empowering developers to create models that are clear, readable, meet business requirements, and remain resilient to change. I''ll explain how concepts like sealed/inline classes, extension functions, constructor overloading, and several others help enrich models, making them more expressive and less error-prone. During the presentation, I''ll refactor real-life code to transform anemic domain structures into something far more idiomatic, legible, and efficient.','{"id": "4fb39c5fc43143d3bb40e901bced8231", "room": "SUB 1", "title": "Beyond data classes: Kotlin‑powered domain modeling", "endsAt": 1764254700000, "category": "[Presentation]", "dayIndex": 1, "speakers": "[Rafał Maciak]", "startsAt": 1764252000000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2025-11-27", "durationMinutes": 45, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2025-11-27T15:45:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2025-11-27T15:00:00"}','[-0.029327095,0.037926234,0.025205193,-0.01250784,0.03228823,0.039276514,-0.073767826,0.014272678,-0.012756576,0.019685635,0.054058507,-0.04744925,0.01029291,-0.020029126,0.023179775,0.0067336243,-0.014320056,-0.009765828,0.033756956,0.056143146,0.031624936,-0.022445414,0.05396375,-0.0014672431,-0.0003142506,0.0104291225,-0.04662013,0.006206542,0.07248862,-0.06040718,0.016321784,-0.030061457,-0.00768711,-0.054579664,0.017778663,-0.0017737207,0.017470704,-0.009836895,-0.0017307842,0.0111042615,-0.01860778,-0.06741916,0.00338754,-0.009155834,-0.036575958,0.080306016,-0.0144148115,-0.01576509,-0.011139795,-0.019839615,-0.080306016,-0.032951526,0.040508345,8.62431e-05,-0.028261086,-0.0031388046,0.016227027,0.047117602,-0.008972243,0.008723508,0.032430366,-0.020491064,0.023831226,0.039323892,-0.07736857,-0.02319162,-0.08670207,-0.016771877,-0.02316793,0.03885011,0.058038272,-0.018974962,-0.060122915,0.069977574,0.013455404,-0.002811599,0.005661693,0.006008146,0.055953633,-0.013443559,-0.0254894