	 ('0d0a4e22-4076-42a6-8164-aee7526b08f0'::uuid,'title:Kotlin Meets AI: How Agents Reshaped the Way I Build Projects, description:AI and AI agents are reshaping how we think, plan, and create software. In this talk, I share my personal journey as a lead engineer learning to work with these tools — where they fit, how to delegate to them, and what new skills the process revealed.

