	 ('de6bced0-72f4-4295-a028-b24e11dd8d64'::uuid,'title:Exploring improvements to ''when'', description:In this talk we look at improvements related to control flow in Kotlin since version 2.0, and how they influence how the code is written:
- Guards to describe side conditions to matches,
- Context-sensitive resolution to omit redundant qualifiers,
- Better exhaustiveness checker.
On top of the syntactic improvements, the talk also discusses how these features interact with smart casting and null safety.

The goal of the talk is to give the audience a deep understanding of all the possibilities of Kotlin matching by version 2.2/2.3 and beyond. Most of the talk consists of examples and refactorings that improve safety or readability.

If time allows, we may also explore some upcoming developments, like subtyping reconstruction.','{"id": "4d6804f3a42244aaae8243bf68b6b862", "room": "Black Box", "title": "Exploring improvements to ''when''", "endsAt": 1764261900000, "category": "[Presentation]", "dayIndex": 1, "speakers": "[Alejandro Serrano Mena]", "startsAt": 1764259200000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2025-11-27", "durationMinutes": 45, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2025-11-27T17:45:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2025-11-27T17:00:00"}','[0.020361409,0.034245927,0.05421209,-0.03881035,-0.016459974,0.01369327,-0.022528872,0.017964449,0.0016399412,0.05666005,0.056711048,-0.0073566264,-0.012711537,0.04365527,0.013795269,0.001186527,-0.008720853,-0.0154017415,0.04595023,0.04674072,-0.003926934,-0.031160478,0.05615006,0.04911218,-0.027310042,-0.03511291,-0.022834867,0.009868335,0.04533824,-0.012711537,0.010773569,-0.019915165,0.0087782275,-0.045669734,-0.032435454,0.017059214,0.04600123,-0.037764866,-0.020348659,-0.0209479,-0.021712886,-0.06339194,-0.03761187,0.02629006,0.021623638,0.03712738,-0.0007211598,0.0017993136,-0.04827069,-0.010129705,-0.06318794,-0.028432023,0.007688121,0.015835235,-0.0031539784,-0.023128113,-0.02567807,0.0010550448,-0.009281845,-0.017569205,-0.007860243,-0.009402967,0.034959912,0.007917617,-0.045593236,0.014560256,-0.059567,-0.008516857,0.01731421,0.016867967,0.05895501,0.021088146,-0.040008828,0.0063079568,-0.0151977455,0.018142946,0.008994974,0.024033347,0.06946084,0.02446684,-0.0130175315,0.018385192,-0.008433984,-0.0028655145,-0.009167097,0.007943117,-0.06374893,-0.02268187,-0.04128381,-0.044777248,-0.015159496,0.02380385,0.007643497,0.02141964,0.07614172,0.019239428,0.015924484,-0.008306486,0.007082506,-0.0019443424,0.018461691,-0.016064731,0.010340077,-0.043731768,0.06808386,-0.0037930615,0.026341058,-0.023383107,-0.035546403,-0.051636633,-0.09990732,-0.017403457,0.0062346454,0.057731032,-0.012252545,0.0057852156,0.0056290305,-0.02687655,-0.017518206,0.002051