	 ('5556bf3c-743b-454c-b862-23610c22d845'::uuid,'title:Framework-Free, Future-Proof: Isolated DDD in Kotlin with (and without) Spring, description:If you want to isolate your domain from your plumbing (you want to), said domain is only truly isolated if it is free from your framework. For Spring this means you cannot use its dependency injection. In this talk I will show you how it can be done with just Kotlin and explore the additional benefits of this approach.','{"id": "439cf35b23cb4d05b909a9b91ea98b2c", "room": "Upperdeck", "title": "Framework-Free, Future-Proof: Isolated DDD in Kotlin with (and without) Spring", "endsAt": 1764242100000, "category": "[Presentation]", "dayIndex": 1, "speakers": "[Jerre van Veluw]", "startsAt": 1764239400000, "phaseOfDay": "MORNING", "conferenceDay": "2025-11-27", "durationMinutes": 45, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2025-11-27T12:15:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2025-11-27T11:30:00"}','[-0.031512924,-0.0067965374,0.04841986,0.011223353,0.09008695,-0.008040798,-0.04464331,0.0061400183,0.012855273,-0.0039453683,0.030537525,-0.032538347,0.030212391,0.026385821,0.04051662,0.009710233,-0.0025526094,-0.0011559429,0.02613572,0.07628129,0.030512515,-0.0046018874,0.06272573,-0.01606909,0.014468434,-0.010341742,-0.02277184,0.015756462,0.03303855,-0.0067590224,0.021133669,-0.03506438,-0.023397097,-0.031813048,0.03874089,0.019182868,0.02606069,0.025710545,-0.009116239,0.00023857442,0.018094921,-0.0638762,-0.013055354,0.012905293,-0.010523066,0.07478067,0.0083221635,0.03864085,-0.009722738,-0.0013294516,-0.051070947,-0.04571875,0.045018464,-0.007903242,-0.03001231,0.0019304793,0.028311612,0.010029114,0.0012981887,0.018582622,0.047094315,-0.013505539,0.016331699,0.043117683,-0.037415348,-0.005358448,-0.043167707,-0.009822779,-0.0024447527,0.0270611,0.025735555,-0.0032700913,-0.027986478,0.023359582,0.0066089607,-0.0021946502,0.03101272,-0.009660212,0.0055085095,0.007465562,-0.04649407,0.0028027121,-0.0052115126,-0.0020352097,-0.010660622,-0.05142109