	 ('d356398f-d478-4a25-bec6-7d00eb4281c4'::uuid,'title:KtLint behind the scenes. Why it matters and how to extend it., description:The Ktlint ecosystem is robust and highly adaptable, making it easy to integrate into any team''s development workflow. By adopting Ktlint in your projects, you ensure a consistent code style and improved readability across your codebase—key factors that directly enhance team productivity and collaboration. And if the default formatting rules don’t fully meet your needs, Ktlint empowers you to define and implement custom rules tailored to your team''s conventions. In this session, you''ll learn not only why Ktlint is a valuable tool, but also how to extend it to fit your unique coding standards.','{"id": "d30956017b9a459fa76f8d5daba17fc5", "room": "SUB 2", "title": "KtLint behind the scenes. Why it matters and how to extend it.", "endsAt": 1764261900000, "category": "[Presentation]", "dayIndex": 1, "speakers": "[Paul Dingemans]", "startsAt": 1764259200000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2025-11-27", "durationMinutes": 45, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2025-11-27T17:45:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2025-11-27T17:00:00"}','[-0.03141228,0.032420445,0.039822493,-0.022444922,0.028228603,0.0071367426,-0.0331633,0.018146958,-0.06234701,0.04290005,0.03380004,0.054706182,-0.009869399,0.01094389,0.040644944,0.039928615,0.017085733,-0.0067454157,-0.023824517,0.0877103,0.004035974,-0.031624526,0.02355921,0.07115518,-0.023068393,-0.02211329,-0.08060009,0.03313677,0.024222476,-0.006798477,-0.0045201583,-0.013663281,-0.03600208,-0.0046428624,0.02894493,0.04345719,0.058049046,0.022551045,0.016767366,0.0015603334,-0.03353473,-0.08187356,-0.0140612405,0.03305718,-0.01605104,-0.018067367,0.0010297205,0.06377966,-0.038336776,0.016011242,-0.014472465,-0.0055847,0.02007043,0.019340837,-0.040989842,-0.012078075,-0.02645105,0.026159212,0.021436758,-0.024912274,0.029661257,-0.0048252605,-0.006951028,0.040989842,-0.075983755,0.009577562,-0.047993932,-0.0